/P 117 0 R
/E (Across the readings, I began highlighting recurring words and concepts. Four that appeared particularly frequently were human, information, function, and connection. Rather than treating these as separate topics, I began thinking about how they relate to one another. These readings pushed me to think about technology as more than a physical object. I'm interested in technology as something that mediates interactions between humans and their environment.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
