/E (I chose the camera because it is a relatively simple technological system that allows me to examine all of these concepts at once. It takes information from the physical world and translates it into a form that humans can store, transport, reproduce, and interpret. To understand the camera as my case study, I wanted to look beyond the camera as an object and instead consider what it actually does. captures visual information from the physical environment that humans cannot.)
